{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B</strong>all Chasers<br>A Multiplayer Party Soccer Brawl Where Rules Don\u2019t Exist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Game:</strong><br>Ball Chasers throws out the rulebook and brings you a 2v2 multiplayer soccer experience full of trolls, goofy characters, and pure chaos. With no referees, no VAR, and no sportsmanship, the only goal is to score <strong>3 points before the other team</strong>\u2014by any means necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2v2 PvP Party Action</strong>: Team up with friends or go head-to-head in fast-paced matches of total mayhem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Classes &amp; Abilities</strong>: Every character comes with wild powers to kick, dash, tackle, or completely mess with the other team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Goofy Chaos</strong>: Cute but slightly evil characters bring charm (and pain) to every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Rules, Only Mayhem</strong>: Forget fair play\u2014anything goes in this arena of madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Party Energy</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, hard to stop laughing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Madness!</strong><br>Are you ready to kick, dash, and troll your way to victory? Grab your squad, embrace the chaos, and score the most ridiculous goals ever!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pounce!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046280/68188278537dfe382d463c0a812abff29fd6fcd9.jpg"},{"name":"ZAP!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046280/67c9564e53ba7bdd5c20a71da1cb8d6c1fce087c.jpg"},{"name":"Earthshatter!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046280/b5deecad3